*  gim_tab_defer_no_template - COMPILER FATAL.  A DEFERRED TAB, TAB(*R),
*  reaches the emitter as IR op=82 with no template, aborting the compile in
*  both m3 and m4 (op NUMBER valid at SCRIP 0b75fa5e -- the enum went
*  alphabetical at 54b6c478, so cite the CONSTRUCT, never the number).
*  Distilled from BASEB.sno's digit lookup, BASEB_ALPHA
*  TAB(*R) LEN(1) . C.
        R  =  3
        'ABCDEF'  TAB(*R)  LEN(1) . C
        OUTPUT  =  C
END
